{"id":"pedido","lemma":"pedido","pos":"noun","rank":889,"glosses":["order (request for some product or service or that which is requested)"],"ipa":"/peˈdido/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"pedidos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-pedido.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me han pedido que te ayude.","en":"I've been asked to help you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568451","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to help","l":"ayudar"}]},{"text":"Perdone, pero yo no he pedido esto.","en":"Excuse me, but I didn't order this.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/35057","words":[{"g":"to pardon","l":"perdonar"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"this"}]},{"text":"No hemos pedido eso.","en":"We didn't order that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/731822","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"heme","l":"hemo"},null,{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Esto no es lo que he pedido.","en":"This isn't what I ordered.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/58096","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"what, that which"]]},{"text":"Desearía haberte pedido consejo.","en":"I wish I had asked you for advice.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598487","words":[{"g":"to wish","l":"desear"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"advice"}]}]}